%%% note
由来: https://docs.mulesoft.com/dataweave/2.11/dw-strings-functions-rightpad (関数ページ)
%%% script
%dw 2.0
import * from dw::core::Strings
output application/json
---
{
  "a": rightPad(null, 3),
  "b": rightPad("", 3),
  "c": rightPad("bat", 5),
  "d": rightPad("bat", 3),
  "e": rightPad("bat", -1)
}
%%% output application/json
{
  "a": null,
  "b": "   ",
  "c": "bat  ",
  "d": "bat",
  "e": "bat"
}
